WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Great to meet you, sir. I'm Mehdi.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Great to meet you. My name is Kai.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Do you, Mehdi, believe that the Constitution is important and good?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Overall, yes.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Do you believe that that Constitution can be eroded through democratic processes?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
What do you mean by erode?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The original intention of the Constitution being destroyed through a purely democratic or legal process.

